'''Martez sisters' repair shop''', also known as '''Martez sisters' garage''', was a garage-turned-repair shop owned by [[Trace Martez|Trace]] and [[Rafa Martez]] on [[Level 1313]] of the [[Coruscant]] [[Coruscant Underworld|underworld]].<ref name="CGSWG">''[[Star Wars Encyclopedia: The Comprehensive Guide to the Star Wars Galaxy]]''</ref> She had inherited it after her [[parent]]s died.<ref name="Deal No Deal">{{TCW|Deal No Deal}}</ref> The shop was on the side of an [[underworld portal]], where it had a landing platform that jutted out into the shaft. Martez kept a modified [[Nebula-class freighter|''Nebula''-class freighter]] she was working on in the shop that she named the ''[[Silver Angel]]''. Martez met former [[Jedi]] [[Padawan]] [[Ahsoka Tano]] when the [[Togruta]] crashed her malfunctioning [[speeder bike]] on the repair shop's landing pad.<ref name="Gone with a Trace" />

During the [[Imperial Era]], the Martez sisters became allies with the former [[Clone Captain|clone captain]] [[Rex]], who would use the space from time to time. After Rex rescued [[Senator]] [[Riyo Chuchi]] from a [[Clone X|clone sniper]] sent by [[Admiral]] [[Edmon Rampart|Rampart]], they brought the imprisoned assassin to the shop for interrogation. However, the clone was unwilling to answer any questions and quickly committed suicide via a [[Electro capsule|suicide shocker]].<ref name="Clone Conspirary">{{TBB|The Clone Conspiracy}}</ref> Rex would soon contact [[Clone Force 99]] to help Senator Chuchi finish her investigation of Rampart, who had been covering up the [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] [[Attack on Kamino|destruction]] of [[Tipoca City]] on [[Kamino]]. The group landed their ship, the ''[[Marauder (Omicron-class)|Marauder]]'', on the shop's landing platform and met with Rex and Chuchi to go over their plan, which was to steal evidence of Rampart's involvement from his [[Venator-class Star Destroyer|''Venator''-class Star Destroyer]] so Chuchi could present it to the [[Imperial Senate]].<ref name="T&C">{{TBB|Truth and Consequences}}</ref>

